//? Title: xoshiro256**: Scrambling a Linear State and Separating Simulation Streams
//? Subtitle: A reversible transition, jump polynomials, multi-seed checks and an Old Faithful bootstrap
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
xoshiro256** combines a four-word linear state transition with a nonlinear
output permutation. We derive the transition's inverse, explain why the
star-star scrambler preserves a uniform word, and distinguish those facts
from the published maximal-period result. Jump polynomials provide widely
separated deterministic stream starting points. A seven-test battery is
examined over two reported 40-seed ranges rather than one attractive run. Finally, the generator
drives a nonparametric bootstrap of the mean waiting time in
`dm::datasets::faithful()`, with an exact conditional variance as an oracle
and jump-separated streams showing Monte Carlo variation.
)

\toc

> The data: two measurements of Old Faithful

The built-in dataset has 272 records: eruption duration and waiting time
to the next eruption, both in minutes. The waiting times are strongly
associated with eruption duration and have two main groups. The simulation
target below is the mean waiting time; no normal distribution is fitted to
the raw waiting-time data.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/xoshiro_faithful.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  const auto data = dm::datasets::faithful();
  std::print("{}\n", data.head(6).to_md());
  std::print("\n{}\n", (data | dm::pivot_longer({"eruptions", "waiting"}, "variable", "minutes") |
      dm::group_by("variable") | dm::summarise(dm::agg::n("n"), dm::agg::mean("minutes", "mean"),
      dm::agg::sd("minutes", "sd"), dm::agg::min("minutes", "min"), dm::agg::max("minutes", "max"))).to_md(4));
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  dm::graphics::RPlot::create().points(data.get_column("eruptions").values(), data.get_column("waiting").values(),
      "eruptions", dm::RGB{37, 99, 235}, 3)
      .title("Old Faithful: eruption duration and subsequent waiting")
      .x_label("eruption duration (minutes)").y_label("waiting time (minutes)")
      .size(900, 480).save_svg("build/xoshiro_faithful.svg");
}
```
